  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, whenever the bravo uses his cunning celerity class feature, he can expend his martial focus or outwit the attacker to have the percentile die rolled twice, taking the best result.</p>\n<p>Additionally, if the bravo avoids an attack using his cunning celerity ability, the bravo can outwit the attacker to make an attack of opportunity against them.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
